+# ML-DSA vectors for K7 and K8 (lifecycle Phase 4, P1.1)
+
+Downloaded 2026-10-21 from the pinned commits below. They are byte-identical to upstream (LF line endings;
+`.gitattributes` marks them `-text`). `tests/k8_vectors.rs` checks each SHA-256 before using a file.
+
+| File | Source | Commit | Bytes | SHA-256 |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `acvp/ML-DSA-sigVer-FIPS204-internalProjection.json` | NIST ACVP-Server, `gen-val/json-files/ML-DSA-sigVer-FIPS204/internalProjection.json` | `a7f283cdc87d2d6dd93c1bac59e5622c5f9f8324` (2026-07-31) | 4,533,178 | `47cdd6314c7f746d02421ffcba89d4dbc7bb875ac49e07a029fdfc26fba55437` |
